id: express-burst-wiki
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: Right after desktop en.wikipedia.org loads (its scripts run for seconds): pinch in, pan, pinch out and double-tap at once — the page follows at the new zoom, nothing flips back, and at rest the text is sharp and nothing is grey
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/HP_TouchPad
kit: cavekit-gpu-rendering.md R3
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:#firstHeading' 60
calibrate 'sel:#firstHeading'
pinch 384 500 400 150
drag 480 900 480 400
pinch 384 500 150 400
dtap 384 500
wait zoom 10
wait settled 8
expect zoom-min 1.0
expect content 0,100,756,700 'sel:body'
